            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThe design of 'mini.jump2d' and `require('mini.jump2d').setup()` will remain the same: single mapping defined in `setup()` with the suggestion to create separate mappings if users want them.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
